   "text": "llts-bench \u2014 two PeerSessions over real loopback UDP, synthetic encoder\n25 kB frames \u00b7 60 Hz \u00b7 12 Mbit/s \u2192 p99 encode-submit \u2192 presented\nCI gate: p99 \u2264 12 ms, every frame presented \u00b7 measured p99 4.9 ms clean, 6.3 ms @5 % loss",
