   "text": "header kind=7 \u00b7 seq = message_index\nstream = receiver_tag | Control | 0\nbody: pattern u8 (0 XX \u00b7 1 XXpsk3 \u00b7 2 IK)\nmessage_index u8 \u00b7 sender_tag u16 \u00b7 Noise \u2264512 B\nmsg 0 is addressed to tag 0 (UNASSIGNED)",
