   "text": "packet key = blake3::derive_key(\"crownos.llts.v1 packet key\",\n    root || direction (1 I\u2192R \u00b7 2 R\u2192I) || stream_id u32 || epoch u32)\none key per (direction, stream, epoch) \u00b7 rekey 120 s or 2\u00b3\u00b2 packets\nKEY_PHASE = epoch & 1 \u00b7 retired key kept 3 s \u00b7 \u2264 16 streams / direction\nreceive: peek \u2192 decrypt (guess, guess+65536) \u2192 replay 1024 bit \u2192 commit",
   "originalText": "packet key = blake3::derive_key(\"crownos.llts.v1 packet key\",\n    root || direction (1 I\u2192R \u00b7 2 R\u2192I) || stream_id u32 || epoch u32)\none key per (direction, stream, epoch) \u00b7 rekey 120 s or 2\u00b3\u00b2 packets\nKEY_PHASE = epoch & 1 \u00b7 retired key kept 3 s \u00b7 \u2264 16 streams / direction\nreceive: peek \u2192 decrypt (guess, guess+65536) \u2192 replay 1024 bit \u2192 commit",
