   "updated": 1762500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RepairBlockGeometry: first_data_index u16 \u00b7 data_shard_count u16 \u00b7 shard_bytes u16 (even) \u00b7 block_byte_offset u32 \u00b7 block_byte_len u32\nparity_index = packet_index \u2212 data_shard_count \u00b7 one Reed-Solomon block per encoded slice\nInput payload (inside Media kind): batch_count u8, then {sequence u16, events_len u16, events} newest first; KEYFRAME = key-state snapshot\nSizing: MTU 1200 \u2212 (28 header + 4 prefix + 14 geometry + 16 tag = 62) \u2192 1138 B payload, even for RS shards\nu16 sequence / frame_id wrap; a < b \u21d4 (a \u2212 b) as i16 < 0 \u00b7 version = 1, peers must match \u00b7 session_tag 0 = unassigned",
   "originalText": "RepairBlockGeometry: first_data_index u16 \u00b7 data_shard_count u16 \u00b7 shard_bytes u16 (even) \u00b7 block_byte_offset u32 \u00b7 block_byte_len u32\nparity_index = packet_index \u2212 data_shard_count \u00b7 one Reed-Solomon block per encoded slice\nInput payload (inside Media kind): batch_count u8, then {sequence u16, events_len u16, events} newest first; KEYFRAME = key-state snapshot\nSizing: MTU 1200 \u2212 (28 header + 4 prefix + 14 geometry + 16 tag = 62) \u2192 1138 B payload, even for RS shards\nu16 sequence / frame_id wrap; a < b \u21d4 (a \u2212 b) as i16 < 0 \u00b7 version = 1, peers must match \u00b7 session_tag 0 = unassigned",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
