   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "provisioned = (E + \u221a(9E)) / k,  E = \u2308loss \u00b7 k\u2309   (mean + 3\u03c3 of a binomial)\nparity shards = \u2308rate \u00b7 k\u2309, \u2265 1 if rate > 0 \u00b7 max 50 % \u00b7 then clamp [min, max]\nloss is the peer-reported \u2030 from transport feedback",
   "originalText": "provisioned = (E + \u221a(9E)) / k,  E = \u2308loss \u00b7 k\u2309   (mean + 3\u03c3 of a binomial)\nparity shards = \u2308rate \u00b7 k\u2309, \u2265 1 if rate > 0 \u00b7 max 50 % \u00b7 then clamp [min, max]\nloss is the peer-reported \u2030 from transport feedback",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
