   "text": "Pure (now, event) \u2192 actions state machine: SliceEncoded \u00b7 DatagramReceived \u00b7 ControlQueued \u00b7 InputQueued \u00b7 TimerExpired \u2026 \u2192 Transmit \u00b7 PresentFrame \u00b7 Deliver \u00b7 SetTargetBitrate \u00b7 PeerDead \u00b7 ArmTimer \u2026",
   "originalText": "Pure (now, event) \u2192 actions state machine: SliceEncoded \u00b7 DatagramReceived \u00b7 ControlQueued \u00b7 InputQueued \u00b7 TimerExpired \u2026 \u2192 Transmit \u00b7 PresentFrame \u00b7 Deliver \u00b7 SetTargetBitrate \u00b7 PeerDead \u00b7 ArmTimer \u2026",
