   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "unreliable, Input lane (2nd priority)\nevents: pointer motion/button/relative,\nscroll v120, key (evdev), touch, Frame\nframing [len u8][postcard] \u2264 32 B\nevery packet repeats the last 4 batches\nreceiver dedups via SequenceWindow\nkey-state snapshot (KEYFRAME flag)\non change and every 500 ms",
   "originalText": "unreliable, Input lane (2nd priority)\nevents: pointer motion/button/relative,\nscroll v120, key (evdev), touch, Frame\nframing [len u8][postcard] \u2264 32 B\nevery packet repeats the last 4 batches\nreceiver dedups via SequenceWindow\nkey-state snapshot (KEYFRAME flag)\non change and every 500 ms",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
