   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1762500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Probe every 1 s idle, 250 ms with media\n(media counts as active 1 s after a frame)\nProbe carries 64-bit counter records \u2192\nreceiver re-syncs sequence extenders\nProbeAck \u2192 RTT sample\n\u2264 8 probes pending\nno inbound for 5 s \u2192 Action::PeerDead",
   "originalText": "Probe every 1 s idle, 250 ms with media\n(media counts as active 1 s after a frame)\nProbe carries 64-bit counter records \u2192\nreceiver re-syncs sequence extenders\nProbeAck \u2192 RTT sample\n\u2264 8 probes pending\nno inbound for 5 s \u2192 Action::PeerDead",
