   "updated": 1762500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RTT = (recv \u2212 sent) \u2212 (peer_sent \u2212 peer_recv)\noffset = sent + RTT/2 \u2212 peer_recv\nkeep the min-RTT sample of every 8\nring of 16 points \u2192 least-squares fit\noffset(now) = a + b\u00b7(now \u2212 origin)\nskew_ppb = b \u00b7 10\u2079\nfallback: Cristian min-RTT baseline\n\u2192 PeerClockUpdated",
   "originalText": "RTT = (recv \u2212 sent) \u2212 (peer_sent \u2212 peer_recv)\noffset = sent + RTT/2 \u2212 peer_recv\nkeep the min-RTT sample of every 8\nring of 16 points \u2192 least-squares fit\noffset(now) = a + b\u00b7(now \u2212 origin)\nskew_ppb = b \u00b7 10\u2079\nfallback: Cristian min-RTT baseline\n\u2192 PeerClockUpdated",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "re711",
