   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "authenticated traffic from a new path\n\u2192 PATH_CHALLENGE probe (xorshift token)\nretry every 200 ms, \u2264 5 tries\nswitch only on a matching ack\nreset CC, SentHistory, RTT\n\u2192 Action::PathChanged\n\u2264 4 remembered paths per connection\nLocalAddressChanged on rebind",
   "originalText": "authenticated traffic from a new path\n\u2192 PATH_CHALLENGE probe (xorshift token)\nretry every 200 ms, \u2264 5 tries\nswitch only on a matching ack\nreset CC, SentHistory, RTT\n\u2192 Action::PathChanged\n\u2264 4 remembered paths per connection\nLocalAddressChanged on rebind",
