   "text": "datagrams 4096 \u00d7 MTU \u00b7 frames 8 \u00d7 1 MiB\nshards 1024 \u00d7 MTU \u00b7 messages 4 \u00d7 64 KiB\nBufferPool = lock-free ArrayQueue,\nPooledBuffer returns on Drop\n\u2264 16 streams \u00b7 \u2264 4 frames in flight\n\u2264 8 RS blocks / frame \u00b7 \u2264 256 parity / block\nStageTimeline: captured \u2192 encoded \u2192\ntransmitted \u2192 received \u2192 assembled \u2192 presented",
   "originalText": "datagrams 4096 \u00d7 MTU \u00b7 frames 8 \u00d7 1 MiB\nshards 1024 \u00d7 MTU \u00b7 messages 4 \u00d7 64 KiB\nBufferPool = lock-free ArrayQueue,\nPooledBuffer returns on Drop\n\u2264 16 streams \u00b7 \u2264 4 frames in flight\n\u2264 8 RS blocks / frame \u00b7 \u2264 256 parity / block\nStageTimeline: captured \u2192 encoded \u2192\ntransmitted \u2192 received \u2192 assembled \u2192 presented",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "re719",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
