   "text": "Sans-IO: runtime feeds NodeInput \u2192 Node::handle, executes every NodeOutput, calls back on next_timeout. bridge.rs maps to/from the Driver.",
   "originalText": "Sans-IO: runtime feeds NodeInput \u2192 Node::handle, executes every NodeOutput, calls back on next_timeout. bridge.rs maps to/from the Driver.",
