   "text": "NodeInput\n\u2022 Presence Seen{beacon, addrs} / Lost\n\u2022 Link: Connected \u00b7 Disconnected \u00b7\n  Message \u00b7 PairingCode \u00b7 Paired \u00b7\n  HandshakeFailed \u00b7 QrOfferReady\n\u2022 LocalState{topic, payload}\n\u2022 App command (pair, forget, features\u2026)\n\u2022 NetworkChanged \u00b7 TimerExpired",
   "originalText": "NodeInput\n\u2022 Presence Seen{beacon, addrs} / Lost\n\u2022 Link: Connected \u00b7 Disconnected \u00b7\n  Message \u00b7 PairingCode \u00b7 Paired \u00b7\n  HandshakeFailed \u00b7 QrOfferReady\n\u2022 LocalState{topic, payload}\n\u2022 App command (pair, forget, features\u2026)\n\u2022 NetworkChanged \u00b7 TimerExpired",
