   "text": "NodeOutput\n\u2022 Driver: Dial \u00b7 OfferQrPairing \u00b7 PairNearby \u00b7\n  PairWithOffer \u00b7 Confirm/Reject \u00b7 Send \u00b7\n  OpenReliable \u00b7 OpenMedia \u00b7 CloseStream \u00b7\n  Forget \u00b7 Rebind\n\u2022 App events (\u2192 UI / JSON)\n\u2022 Media Start/Stop \u00b7 Persist\n\u2022 ExportFfspLink \u00b7 Advertise(beacons)",
