   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Capabilities{codecs, features, class} on Control 0 \u2192 shared = local \u2229 enabled \u2229 peer \u2192 Subscribe / Unsubscribe topics\nSubscribe \u2192 Snapshot (authoritative, clears absent topics; spills into Updates if > 64 KiB)\ntopics: DeviceInfo \u00b7 Battery \u00b7 MediaSession \u00b7 CallState \u00b7 Notifications \u00b7 Clipboard \u00b7 Volume \u00b7 Hotspot (u16 bitmask)\nclipboard winner = max(HLC{wall_ms, counter}, origin DeviceId) \u00b7 inline \u2264 60 KiB, else an ffsp file offer",
   "originalText": "Capabilities{codecs, features, class} on Control 0 \u2192 shared = local \u2229 enabled \u2229 peer \u2192 Subscribe / Unsubscribe topics\nSubscribe \u2192 Snapshot (authoritative, clears absent topics; spills into Updates if > 64 KiB)\ntopics: DeviceInfo \u00b7 Battery \u00b7 MediaSession \u00b7 CallState \u00b7 Notifications \u00b7 Clipboard \u00b7 Volume \u00b7 Hotspot (u16 bitmask)\nclipboard winner = max(HLC{wall_ms, counter}, origin DeviceId) \u00b7 inline \u2264 60 KiB, else an ffsp file offer",
