   "text": "StartMirror{direction, limits, remote_input} \u00b7 StartCamera \u00b7 StartMic \u00b7 StartMonitor \u00b7 UnicursorEnter/Leave \u00b7 Stop",
   "originalText": "StartMirror{direction, limits, remote_input} \u00b7 StartCamera \u00b7 StartMic \u00b7 StartMonitor \u00b7 UnicursorEnter/Leave \u00b7 Stop",
