   "updated": 1762500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "JNI \u2014 21 natives\n\nlifecycle: start \u00b7 stop \u00b7 nextEvent\npairing: scanQr \u00b7 beginPairing \u00b7\ncancel \u00b7 pairNearby \u00b7 confirm \u00b7 forget\nfeatures: set \u00b7 start \u00b7 stop \u00b7\nsendCommand\nstate: publishStateJson\n(JSON \u2192 postcard, HLC re-stamp)\ndiscovery: presence \u00b7 networkChanged\n\u00b7 advertisements\nmedia: sendInput \u00b7 createEncoder\nSurface \u00b7 attach/detachDecoder\n\nhandles = registry ids, not pointers",
   "originalText": "JNI \u2014 21 natives\n\nlifecycle: start \u00b7 stop \u00b7 nextEvent\npairing: scanQr \u00b7 beginPairing \u00b7\ncancel \u00b7 pairNearby \u00b7 confirm \u00b7 forget\nfeatures: set \u00b7 start \u00b7 stop \u00b7\nsendCommand\nstate: publishStateJson\n(JSON \u2192 postcard, HLC re-stamp)\ndiscovery: presence \u00b7 networkChanged\n\u00b7 advertisements\nmedia: sendInput \u00b7 createEncoder\nSurface \u00b7 attach/detachDecoder\n\nhandles = registry ids, not pointers",
